      {
        "id": 1879735179,
        "content": "There is the frontend [log application](https://github.com/ubiquity/ubiquibot/tree/development/log-app) which displays all of the logs produced by the bot. \r\nWe should move it to a separate repository in order not to: \r\n- mess log and bot deploy scripts together\r\n- apply a shared cloudflare pages deploy [workflow](https://github.com/ubiquity/.github/blob/main/.github/workflows/deploy.yml)\r\nWhat should be done:\r\n1. Move the [log app](https://github.com/ubiquity/ubiquibot/tree/development/log-app) to a separate repo\r\n2. Remove the log app's related code from the https://github.com/ubiquity/ubiquibot repo\r\n3. Deploy the log app to cloudflare pages using this [workflow](https://github.com/ubiquity/.github/blob/main/.github/workflows/deploy.yml)\r\nP.S. When we are done moving the log app to a separate repo we should configure stage and prod [supabase API keys](https://github.com/ubiquity/ubiquibot/blob/development/log-app/scripts/constants/index.ts).",
