        "id": 1752416754,
        "content": "@gitcoindev \r\nThis [generic workflow](https://github.com/ubiquity/.github/blob/main/.github/workflows/deploy.yml) can be used from any public repository across the whole github regardless of the organization the original (i.e. generic) workflow belongs to.\r\nI don't actually remember whether the logger app has ever been deployed to one of our servers (i.e. netlify instances).\r\nWe should use the [generic workflow](https://github.com/ubiquity/.github/blob/main/.github/workflows/deploy.yml).\r\nWe use it at least for pay.ubq.fi ([example](https://github.com/ubiquity/pay.ubq.fi/blob/development/.github/workflows/continuous-deploy.yml)).",
